    },
    "Support ShoutKit" : {

    },
    "The app and its feature packages are GPL-3.0; the reusable RadioDirectory, Playback, Persistence, and DesignSystem packages are MIT. The ShoutKit name and icon are trademarks and not covered by these licenses." : {

    },
    "Third-Party" : {
      "comment" : "A heading for the third-party licenses.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Version" : {

    },
    "When on, playing a Radio-Browser station sends its public station ID (nothing about you or your device) so the community directory can rank popularity. Album artwork lookups send the current track's artist and title to Apple's iTunes Search API; turn this off to always show station artwork instead. Listen Now puts popular stations from your region first, using your device's region setting, never your location. ShoutKit has no analytics, no ads, and no accounts." : {

    }
